## ⚙️ Installation & Workspace Setup

Ensure you have [Node.js](https://nodejs.org) installed (v16+ recommended).

1. Clone the repository into your local workspace:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com
   cd Rally-Test-Case-Generator
   ```

2. Install system dependencies:
   ```bash
   npm install
   ```

3. Launch the engine in development mode:
   ```bash
   npm start
   ```

---

## 🧪 Quality Assurance & Test Coverage

Built with a quality-first engineering mindset. Every data-mapping function, structural schema validation model, and input-parsing edge case is fully covered by an automated unit testing suite.

To run the automated validation layer and audit code execution:
```bash
npm test
```

### Strategic Test Metrics Covered:
*   **Schema Consistency Validation:** Guarantees output payloads map directly to target data fields without data truncation.
*   **Boundary & Empty-State Handling:** Verifies the engine rejects malformed input objects cleanly without throwing unhandled exceptions or risking memory leaks.
*   **Data Serialization Audits:** Ensures correct mapping arrays are generated deterministically across asynchronous processing loops.

